    "body": "## Problem\r\nWhen PR #40621 removed a 50 cell restriction to item group minwid, a possible integer overflow was introduced when the added padding is multiplied with the number of fillchar bytes.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\nWhen there is not enough buffer capacity left, reduce the number of added fillchars before calculating the number of added bytes.\r\n",
